---
// WhoThisIsFor.astro - UK specific section
---

<section class="py-20 bg-bg-base section-fade-in">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-4">
        Who this is for
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-text-secondary max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        We work with tradespeople and local service businesses across the UK who want a professional online presence that brings in work.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 icon-list">
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-accent-primary/30 transition-all icon-list-item">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-2">Tradespeople</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
          Plumbers, electricians, builders, roofers, plasterers, decorators, carpenters, and all skilled trades.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-accent-primary/30 transition-all icon-list-item">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-2">Home Services</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
          Cleaners, gardeners, landscapers, removals, window cleaners, pest control, and property maintenance.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-accent-primary/30 transition-all icon-list-item">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-2">Health & Wellness</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
          Personal trainers, physiotherapists, massage therapists, yoga instructors, and wellness practitioners.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-accent-primary/30 transition-all icon-list-item">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-2">Beauty & Personal Care</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
          Hairdressers, barbers, beauticians, nail technicians, makeup artists, and mobile beauty services.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-accent-primary/30 transition-all icon-list-item">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-2">Professional Services</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
          Tutors, consultants, photographers, driving instructors, accountants, and other professional services.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-accent-primary/30 transition-all icon-list-item">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m4 6h.01M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-2">Local Businesses</h3>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">
          Cafes, restaurants, shops, event venues, caterers, florists, and other local businesses serving their community.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
